2 CONT Vital de Bettencourt de Vasconcellos established his residence and a second branch of the Bettencourt family in São Mateus da Calheta, Terceira. This branch of the family also owned the small palace on Rua da Rosa in the same city
2 CONC ; it was transformed into an episcopal residence and was later converted into a national secondary school
2 CONT
