2 CONT Familias-Argentinas (Argentinian Family Tree)  MyHeritage  In the Familias Argentinas collection you can find not only information on most of Argentinian personalities, but also many proven connections to European royal families f
2 CONC rom Spain, France, England, and other countries (for example Windsor and Romanov families are connected to Argentinian families). The oldest branches date back as far as 350 years after Christ. All of the data has been uploaded on
2 CONC e by one to maintain the coherence of the database and to avoid duplicity. But more importantly, every single name is added only if it links to any of the existing family branches that Familias Argentinas tracks. This feature, in 
2 CONC turn, assures Familias Argentinas that the database is the biggest South American database in which all 130,000 people are connected to each other.  Collection  10097  MH:S500010 
