2 CONT Nicolás married María Antonia Sojo y Palacios, daughter of Juan Feliciano de (7344) Sojo y Palacios and Isabel María Gil de Arratia, on 5 Apr 1763 in Caracas, Libertador, Distrito Federal, Venezuela.1 (María Antonia Sojo y Palacio
2 CONC s was born in Caracas, Libertador, Distrito Federal, Venezuela and died before 28 Feb 1798 in Caracas, Libertador, Distrito Federal, Venezuela 3.)
