2 CONT Vicente Isidro de Ibarra y Galindo [Parents] was born on 4 Apr 1758 in Caracas, Libertador, D.C., Venezuela. He died on 20 Aug 1832 in Caracas, Libertador, D.C., Venezuela. He was baptized on 12 Apr  1758 in the Caracas D.F. Venez
2 CONC uela temple. His endowment was submitted. He married Ana Teresa de Rodriguez del Toro é Ibarra on 16 Sep 1793 in Caracas, Libertador, D.C., Venezuela. Vicente was confirmed a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Sain
2 CONC ts on 12 Apr 1758 in Carac - Caracas D.F. Venezuela.
